      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/airnewsalerts/status/1956037684880671061",
      "text": "#DelhiPolice has issued a traffic advisory in the national capital regarding the Independence Day Ceremony at Red Fort tomorrow for the convenience of the public and security reasons. \n\nSeveral roads will be closed for general traffic from 4.00 AM to 10.00 AM, with only labelled vehicles permitted.\n\nThese include – Netaji Subhash Marg, S P Mukherjee Marg, Chandni Chowk road, Esplanade road and ring road from Rajghat to ISBT. \n\nDelhi Police have also advised the public to avoid C- Hexagon India Gate, Copernicus Marg, Mandi House, A point Tilak Marg and Mathura Road.\n\n#IndependenceDay | #IDayWithAkashvani | #𝟕𝟗𝐭𝐡𝐈𝐧𝐝𝐞𝐩𝐞𝐧𝐝𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞𝐃𝐚𝐲 | #HarGharTiranga | @dtptraffic",
